{"title":"Imp","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 1 Imp that attacks with burn (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(138.7px,-694.6px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-2/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-512px;top:512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-2/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-512px;top:768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-1/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-1/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/0/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/0/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:768px\"><i style=\"left:-115.5px;top:658.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:-165.0px;top:683.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:-131.2px;top:666.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:-154.0px;top:686.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:-140.2px;top:682.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:-154.0px;top:710.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:-145.7px;top:709.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:-115.5px;top:694.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:-96.3px;top:695.8px\"></i></div><figcaption>Windthorne</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Windthorne\">Windthorne</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 7 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Den\">Ogre Den</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Smoldering%20Den\">Smoldering Den</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></l